     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><br><br></span><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">Good Day Dr. Altuna,  I have 2 questions regarding the PCA function in your methyl-kit package </font></span><br><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"></span><br><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">1- Regarding the function itself: can I peek to the PCA like the function summary with prcomp r function ? how I can manipulate the plots ? </font></span><br><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"></span><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">I have read the documentation of PCASamples() function and I see it is based on prcomp and accept methylation percentage matrix, </font></span><br><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"></span><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"></span></div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">so I generated the matrix using the function mat=percMethylation() and tried to use prcomp directly but it didn&#39;t work, did I miss something?</font></span></div><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:100%\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><code>\r\n</code></span><br>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:100%\"><br>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0.98in;margin-bottom:0in;font-weight:normal;line-height:100%\" align=\"left\">\r\n<font face=\"Consol\"><font style=\"font-size:11pt\" size=\"2\"></font></font></p><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;margin-left:40px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">mat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">percMethylation</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">meth</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>prcomp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> scale </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>plot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">prcomp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>summary</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">prcomp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>biplot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">prcomp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> scale </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span></div></code></div><p style=\"margin-left:1.3934in;margin-bottom:0in;font-weight:normal;line-height:100%\" align=\"left\"><font face=\"Consol\"><font style=\"font-size:11pt\" size=\"2\"><br></font></font></p><p style=\"margin-left:1.3934in;margin-bottom:0in;font-weight:normal;line-height:100%\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><font style=\"font-size:11pt\" size=\"2\"><br></font></span></p><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><br><font size=\"2\">2<font size=\"2\">- is \r\nregarding general approach advise, I have generated the plots below, as \r\nyou can see both PCA analysis and clustering produced perfect separation\r\n between the Rat tissue types.</font></font></span></div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\"><font size=\"2\">In the next steps, I want to isolates \r\nregions in PC1 and PC2 which contributed the most to this separation, \r\nthen I want to categorize them, tissue specific genes,  genes promoters, \r\nislands, enhancer, etc.</font></font><font size=\"2\"><font size=\"2\"> I’m guessing I need to used genmoation \r\npackage but I cannot link it to my PCA results, I only know how to annotate \r\nthe DMRs like described in the tutorial. </font></font><br>PS. my Data is single based resolution (~1.5 m CpG) from agilent sureselect targeted enriched system (not Whole genome RBSS).<br></span><br><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"></span><br> <p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/methylkit_discussion/attach/44e76a12902f7/Auto%20Generated%20Inline%20Image%201?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"338\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/methylkit_discussion/attach/44e76a12902f7/Auto%20Generated%20Inline%20Image%202?part=0.2&amp;view=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"337\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div style=\"text-align:left\"><br></div></div><br><br> <div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><br><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><font size=\"4\">my code is below </font></span><br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> <br><br> <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#--------------loading------------ </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">TxDb</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Rnorvegicus</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">UCSC</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rn4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ensGene</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">genomation</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dplyr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">GenomicRanges</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">methylKit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">foreach</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">doMC</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>registerDoMC</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">20</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#####-------reading----------############## </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>ids </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;blood_1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;blood_2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;cortex_1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;cortex_2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;hippo_f_1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;hippo_f_2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;hippo_f_3&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;hippo_f_4.&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;hippo_m_1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;hippo_m_2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;hippo_m_3&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;hippo_m_4&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;hypoth_1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;hypoth_2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;liver_1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;liver_2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># f &lt;- list.files(pattern = &quot;replicat&quot;) </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># read methylRaw objects to a list in parallel </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#--------------------------- for Each loop </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>allSamples </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">foreach</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">length</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">f</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dopar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> methRead</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> f</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">id </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ids</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> assembly </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;rn4&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> pipeline </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># how is your data files structred </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br> fraction </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> chr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">col </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> start</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">col </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">end</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">col </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> coverage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">col </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> strand</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">col </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> freqC</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">col </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\">treatment </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># make a new methylRawList object from the list </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>myobj </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">new</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;methylRawList&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> allSamples</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> treatment </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br><br> <br><br>filtered</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">myobj</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">filterByCoverage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">myobj</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lo</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">count</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lo</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">perc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> hi</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">count</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hi</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">perc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">99.9</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">16</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> getCoverageStats</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">filtered</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">myobj</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]],</span><span style=\"color:#000\">plot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">both</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">strands</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">######----PCA--------####### </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>meth</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">unite</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">filtered</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">myobj</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> destrand</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>head</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">meth</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>clusterSamples</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">meth</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dist</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;correlation&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> method</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;ward&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> plot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">PCASamples</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">meth</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> screeplot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span st