     1,
     "<div>so I have solved the first question <br></div><div><br></div><div>it turns out one of the parameters of the function <b>PCASamples </b>need to be changes from default (False )  to TRUE to return regular PC object <br></div><div><br></div><div>For the second question, I will try to extract the first component from the object and perform some row wise clustering, not sure if it will do for my purpose ! <br></div><div><br></div><div><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/methylkit_discussion/attach/4faa2e0033032/Auto%20Generated%20Inline%20Image%201?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"132\"></div>"
    ],
